{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は京都で、個別握手会がありました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部から5部までたくさんの方が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会いに来てくれて本当に嬉しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっそく！洋服と髪型は～、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部が友達と浅草に遊びに行った時の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お洋服！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写メを撮り忘れちゃったんだけど、、！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部は予告通りの悪魔っぽいのを着たよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、悪魔なんだけどね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"間違いなく悪魔なんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あまりにもいろんな人に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒猫ちゃん？とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねこみみかわいいね！とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"猫っぽいそれを言われるので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悪魔としての自信をなくしたよ(｡ρω-｡)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"猫っぽいそれを言われるたびに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"違うよ！悪魔！デビル！って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言ってたけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"途中で、うん！ねこみ